OL,3,GNEWSA'I woke up one day in my 60s and
OL,4,Adecided to become an artist'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGina Long has lived what she says has
OL,7,Fbeen a "very amazing life", but she
OL,8,Fnever expected to wake up one day in
OL,9,Fher 60s and feel a desire to host her
OL,10,Fown art exhibition.
OL,12,FFrom raising millions for charity,
OL,13,Fbeing friends with football legend Sir
OL,14,FBobby Robson, to being appointed MBE,
OL,15,Fshe has had a long varied career.
OL,17,FIn 2020, it was global superstar and
OL,18,FSuffolk's own Ed Sheeran who opened her
OL,19,Feyes to the world of art and she began
OL,20,Fdabbling with paint from her Bury St
OL,21,FEdmunds home.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
