OL,3,GNEWSA'I woke up one day in my 60s and
OL,4,Adecided to become an artist'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 64-year-old has since created more
OL,7,Fthan 30 pieces of work ready for her
OL,8,Fdebut exhibition, Square Peg Round
OL,9,FHole, being held for free at St
OL,10,FEdmundsbury Cathedral on Wednesday and
OL,11,FThursday.
